DESCRIPTION:Introduction to R - March 2025\nThe goal of this workshop is to
	 teach novice programmers to write modular code and best practices for usi
	ng R for data analysis. We'll focus on building a strong foundation in the
	 fundamentals of R and teaching best practices for scientific computing (b
	reaking down analyses into modular units\, task automation\, and encapsula
	tion). The workshop is geared to those with little to no programming exper
	ience. \n\nImportant Dates:\n\n*	\n	Sign-up form closes - Friday\, Februar
	y 14\, at 5pm ET\n*	\n	Registrants notified - Week of February 17\n*	\n	In
	troduction session - Monday\, March 3 from 2-3pm ET\n*	\n	Workshop session
	s - Tuesdays in March (3/4\, 3/11\, 3/18\, 3/25) from 1-5pm ET\n\nRequirem
	ents:\n\n*	\n	There is no cost to attend these workshops\, but selected pa
	rticipants will be asked to commit to attend the introduction and workshop
	 session and get supervisory approval in DOI Talent.\n*	\n	Participants ma
	y be required to install some software on their computers\, which might re
	quire USGS ServiceDesk assistance.\n\nAdditional Information:\n\n*	\n	This
	 workshop will cover the R for Reproducible Scientific Analysis lesson mat
	erial <https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fs
	wcarpentry.github.io%2Fr-novice-gapminder%2Findex.html&data=05%7C02%7Csfor
	mel%40usgs.gov%7C2470e29075a9417bfa0f08dd3a6e21e7%7C0693b5ba4b184d7b9341f3
	2f400a5494%7C0%7C0%7C638730966862327190%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU
	1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoy
	fQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=%2FeerW%2BWljSFiNPxUnmyROPnZtls%2FP%2F3YYoKN60
	T6AYQ%3D&reserved=0> .\n*	\n	Spots will be limited to provide the best onl
	ine experience for the learners.\n*	\n	Priority will be given to participa
	nts that work for the USGS.\n*	\n	Participants will be selected across dis
	ciplines\, mission areas and regions\, considering their reason(s) for wan
	ting to participate in the workshop.\n\nIf you're interested in attending\
	, please fill out the sign-up form <https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.out
	look.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fforms.office.com%2Fg%2FFKn677Ya8N&data=05%7C02
	%7Csformel%40usgs.gov%7C2470e29075a9417bfa0f08dd3a6e21e7%7C0693b5ba4b184d7
	b9341f32f400a5494%7C0%7C0%7C638730966862347766%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJ
	FbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsI
	ldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=W6LJfGTbIys4uGUUnxD7DnnbmqIxs73mJX011Lw
	v5CY%3D&reserved=0> . The sign-up form will close on Friday February 14\, 
	at 5pm ET.\n\n\n__________________________________________________________
	______________________\nMicrosoft Teams Need help? <https://gcc02.safelink
	s.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Faka.ms%2FJoinTeamsMeeting%3Fom
